{
  "name": "@dshtrading/connector-tiger",
  "description": "老虎证券（Tiger Trade）港股连接器：直连券商 OpenAPI 网关（openapi.itiger.com/gateway，RSA2 签名 + BYOK 私钥 ref），行情面 fail-closed（上游失败即抛结构化错误，零跨源回落）；实现 MarketDataService/TradeService 与 5 个 hk_* 工具；dry-run 缺省、liveTrading 只是非权威镜像（放行归 @dshtrading/authority 人工签署）。",
  "version": "0.6.1",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "types": "./lib/index.d.ts",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "types": "./lib/index.d.ts",
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./dataplane": {
      "types": "./lib/dataplane.d.ts",
      "default": "./lib/dataplane.js"
    },
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib"
  ],
  "license": "PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0",
  "scripts": {
    "build": "tsdown",
    "test": "vitest run"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "@dshtrading/authority": "workspace:^",
    "@dshtrading/api": "workspace:^"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": ">=4.0.0",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools": ">=0.2.1-rc.2",
    "@deepseek-ai/schemastery": ">=3.18.0"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "tsdown": "^0.22.0",
    "vitest": "^3.0.0"
  }
}
